 34CL4cL deuteron, proton, and neutron, respectively. 1.53 is a normalization   
 34CL5cL factor related to the use of Hulthen wavefunction for the deuteron     
 34CL6cL (1966Ba54). The overall uncertainty in C{+2}S is estimated to be about 
